    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/32c80cf873a74de56395cc48842003ac.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can check in any time you like ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOID OBSCURA is an anime-inspired, dark fantasy visual novel set within a creepy, underground cryogenics facility called Intermine Laboratories. At one time a beacon of hope for humanity's survival, its foundations have given way to decay, allowing nature to reclaim what rightfully belongs to her. It's become Intermine Laboratories' policy to void all cryogenic contracts and leave patients in stasis \u2014 <i>indefinitely</i>. That is, until Joseph McPherson, Eric Eastwick and William McKinley are inexplicably awoken from their eternal slumber and left to uncover the secrets behind Intermine's downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beginning of the End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is much more going on behind the scenes of Intermine Laboratories. Hiding in the shadows are a legion of genetic abominations, cannibals and more. If you're going to guide Joseph, Eric and William out of this twisted labyrinth, you'll need to familiarize yourself with your surroundings. What are the Tenebrae? The Nox? Where are your loved ones? Just why did you come to Intermine Laboratories in the first place? Each of these questions \u2014 and many more \u2014 will be answered in VOID OBSCURA! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/179ede27195664fe456650f24d857249.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VOID OBSCURA, you will play as (and <i>encounter</i>) a wide variety of interesting characters with compelling stories to tell. Here's just a taste of what's in store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/5cc444d19a0313110c163c8b810fa582.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/33936dedf0721e07a4d0156d527c3a17.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/014e246d9fedcb39d43343fcbf8dbf80.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/3d126c70e561cf30966c646deb1f8a15.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/60d5969f2d9ee7b97f633fb1c5c113f3.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/c3b7834f8bd2b7982011e9dce47e3d28.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/a54f3e145acf99c3fc3d28a9100c2b7f.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features Included in VOID OBSCURA:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A creepy, anime-inspired world crafted over the course of fifteen real-world years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Characters and BGs created by A Sleepy Witch's Atelier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An encyclopedic database of world-building written (<i>in-universe</i>) by a highly-advanced (<i>and sarcastic</i>) AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An original soundtrack by indie musician Bannister Chaava.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/32c80cf873a74de56395cc48842003ac.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can check in any time you like ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOID OBSCURA is an anime-inspired, dark fantasy visual novel set within a creepy, underground cryogenics facility called Intermine Laboratories. At one time a beacon of hope for humanity's survival, its foundations have given way to decay, allowing nature to reclaim what rightfully belongs to her. It's become Intermine Laboratories' policy to void all cryogenic contracts and leave patients in stasis \u2014 <i>indefinitely</i>. That is, until Joseph McPherson, Eric Eastwick and William McKinley are inexplicably awoken from their eternal slumber and left to uncover the secrets behind Intermine's downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beginning of the End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is much more going on behind the scenes of Intermine Laboratories. Hiding in the shadows are a legion of genetic abominations, cannibals and more. If you're going to guide Joseph, Eric and William out of this twisted labyrinth, you'll need to familiarize yourself with your surroundings. What are the Tenebrae? The Nox? Where are your loved ones? Just why did you come to Intermine Laboratories in the first place? Each of these questions \u2014 and many more \u2014 will be answered in VOID OBSCURA! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/179ede27195664fe456650f24d857249.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VOID OBSCURA, you will play as (and <i>encounter</i>) a wide variety of interesting characters with compelling stories to tell. Here's just a taste of what's in store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/5cc444d19a0313110c163c8b810fa582.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/33936dedf0721e07a4d0156d527c3a17.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/014e246d9fedcb39d43343fcbf8dbf80.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/3d126c70e561cf30966c646deb1f8a15.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/60d5969f2d9ee7b97f633fb1c5c113f3.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/c3b7834f8bd2b7982011e9dce47e3d28.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527310/extras/a54f3e145acf99c3fc3d28a9100c2b7f.avif?t=1741470898\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features Included in VOID OBSCURA:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A creepy, anime-inspired world crafted over the course of fifteen real-world years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Characters and BGs created by A Sleepy Witch's Atelier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An encyclopedic database of world-building written (<i>in-universe</i>) by a highly-advanced (<i>and sarcastic</i>) AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An original soundtrack by indie musician Bannister Chaava.</p></li></ul>",
